{"version":1,"content":"<p>日本宇宙航空研究開發機構（JAXA）今日（20日）利用H3火箭10號機，從鹿兒島縣的種子島宇宙中心發射火星衛星探測計劃「MMX」探測器。</p><p>JAXA宣布探測器已與火箭分離並進入軌道，發射成功。</p><p>（共同社）</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:06.779395+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":101,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T02:15:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T04:57:38.668891+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:57:40.684287+00:00","content_hash":"ec8ce9b3414d1ff42b2da86467e0acadae087d5be766afcc47618be83b7a0906","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}